  "descriptions": {
    "en": {
      "language": "en",
      "value": "Excel file containing macro commands making it possible to transform a 1/0 table (presence / absence) into a graphic matrix treated by matrix permutations; it is possible to take into account the uncertain presence of a character. The instructions for use are contained in the file."
    }
  },
